        "created_at": "2021-04-23T10:42:00.574Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Minions can be super dangerous if not dealt with.  If players and GMs don’t embrace the Twists things can slow down.</p>\n<p>In the game I just started the characters are new heroes following the OblivAeon event and training under the Sentinels of Freedom.  They’ve stumbled onto a plot by someone to acquire the relics of Gloomweaver in order to bring them into the world fully.  In our first game a Major Twist resulted in Ermine recognizing one of the heroes (a reformed criminal) and then escaping police custody.</p>",
